ask(1794,'end-to-end','Concurrent input branches joining context','Suppose vision and audio branches start together and finish after 70 ms and 110 ms. Their join is followed serially by 10 ms context integration, 180 ms to first generated audio and 40 ms playback startup. When does playback begin?', [('340 ms','Wait for the slower branch:110+10+180+40=340 ms.'),('410 ms','That sums the concurrent 70 ms and 110 ms branches as if serial.'),('300 ms','That omits the 40 ms playback startup.')],kind='numerical',difficulty='medium',ck='figure',ass=['All supplied durations; no additional queueing; both modalities required; downstream stages do not overlap.'],steps=['The parallel join completes at max(70,110)=110 ms.','Add context, first-audio generation and playback startup delays.'],formulas=[LAT])
